#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# is_exception

#% text
# `is_exception(x)` is `true` when `x` is `exception(type, data)`.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# An exception that has been thrown is a failure, `failure(thrown, exc, type)`, not an exception.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
is_exception(exception(data_error))
#% output
#= true

#% cell
is_exception(3)
#% output
#= false

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `exception`, `is_failure`
